{"html":"<span id=\"requiredargsconstructor\" class=\"article-title-anchor\"></span>\n<p>Lombok 提供的注解，用于自动生成一个包含 <code>final</code> 字段或 <code>@NonNull</code> 字段的构造函数。通过此注解可以省略手动编写构造方法，简化代码。</p>\n<h3 id=\"1-requiredargsconstructor-的作用\">1. <code>@RequiredArgsConstructor</code> 的作用</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>生成构造函数，为所有被<code>final</code>、<code>@NonNull</code>修饰的字段增加一个构造方法</li>\n<li>简化依赖注入，因为会生成构造函数，所以在spring等框架中字段上可以不用<code>@AutoWired</code>来自动注入</li>\n<li>支持不可变对象</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"2-使用-requiredargsconstructor\">2. 使用 <code>@RequiredArgsConstructor</code></h3>\n<h4 id=\"21-基本用法\">2.1 基本用法</h4>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>java</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-java\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> lombok.RequiredArgsConstructor;\n\n<span class=\"hljs-meta\">@RequiredArgsConstructor</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">User</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">private</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">final</span> String username;\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">private</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">final</span> <span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> age;\n}\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Lombok 会生成以下构造函数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>java</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-java\"><span class=\"hljs-type\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">User</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">(String username, <span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> age)</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">this</span>.username = username;\n    <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">this</span>.age = age;\n}\n</code></pre></div>\n<h4 id=\"22-结合-nonnull\">2.2 结合 <code>@NonNull</code></h4>\n<p>与<a href=\"/StarYunFanSite/notes/major/%E7%BC%96%E7%A8%8B%E8%AF%AD%E8%A8%80/JAVA/%E4%BE%9D%E8%B5%96/Lombok/%E6%B3%A8%E8%A7%A3/%40RequiredArgsConstructor.md.html#21-%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E7%94%A8%E6%B3%95\" data-note-path=\"major/编程语言/JAVA/依赖/Lombok/注解/@RequiredArgsConstructor.md\" data-note-anchor=\"21-基本用法\">#2.1 基本用法</a>类似，在字段上添加<code>@NonNull</code>注解后生成：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>java</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-java\"><span class=\"hljs-type\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">User</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">(<span class=\"hljs-meta\">@NonNull</span> String username, <span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> age)</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (username == <span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span>) {\n        <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">throw</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">NullPointerException</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;username is marked non-null but is null&quot;</span>);\n    }\n    <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">this</span>.username = username;\n    <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">this</span>.age = age;\n}\n</code></pre></div>\n","toc":[{"level":3,"text":"1. @RequiredArgsConstructor 的作用","id":"1-requiredargsconstructor-的作用"},{"level":3,"text":"2. 使用 @RequiredArgsConstructor","id":"2-使用-requiredargsconstructor"},{"level":4,"text":"2.1 基本用法","id":"21-基本用法"},{"level":4,"text":"2.2 结合 @NonNull","id":"22-结合-nonnull"}]}